--! A test platform's one capability: make every later file read fail with
--! an error `Io.readFile` does not name (`boundary.md` §4.1) — `EIO`, the
--! disk's own failure, which no program can arrange by itself.

--| From now on, every `fs.promises.readFile` rejects with `EIO`.
pub foreign impure breakReads : () → ()
